-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 6, §6.13 מורה יועץ
-- The counselling teacher in a post-primary school: who may be appointed,
-- whose approval the placement needs, and the counselling reward.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `6.13 מורה יועץ`

DECLARE `counsellor placement action` IS ONE OF
    `place a counselling teacher` HAS `approved by the district's senior counsellor` IS A BOOLEAN

@desc The counselling reward, whose amount section 1.12 (appointments and rewards of post-holders) sets; an input until 1.12 is encoded.
ASSUME `the counselling reward set by section 1.12` IS A NUMBER

§§ `6.13.1 יחידת עבודה`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_13__ssec_6_13_1/p1 A pointer: the counsellor's work unit is the one section 3.12.1 sets, encoded there.

§§ `6.13.2 מינוי`

@desc A candidate for the post of counselling teacher in a post-primary school, as far as section 6.13.2 asks about them.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_13__ssec_6_13_2__para_1/p1
DECLARE `counsellor candidate` HAS
    `has completed university training in counselling` IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds an MA`                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `is studying towards an MA`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `has teaching experience`                          IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_13__ssec_6_13_2__para_1/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_13__ssec_6_13_2__para_1__subpara_a akn:chp_6__sec_6_13__ssec_6_13_2__para_1__subpara_b
GIVEN c IS A `counsellor candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the education requirements for a counselling teacher` c IF
        c's `has completed university training in counselling`
    AND c's `has teaching experience`

-- §6.13.2.1א's bracket: among candidates who meet the requirements, an MA
-- holder or MA student is preferred. A preference, not a condition.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_13__ssec_6_13_2__para_1__subpara_a
GIVEN c IS A `counsellor candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a preferred candidate` c IF
        `meets the education requirements for a counselling teacher` c
    AND (c's `holds an MA` OR c's `is studying towards an MA`)

-- §6.13.2.2: placing a counselling teacher in a counselling post needs the
-- approval of the district's senior counsellor of שפ"י (see also section
-- 3.12.2). The text does not say who places; the employer is read as the
-- one who does.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_13__ssec_6_13_2__para_2
GIVEN c IS A `counsellor candidate`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `counsellor placement action`
DECIDE `placing a counselling teacher` c IS
    IF `meets the education requirements for a counselling teacher` c
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MAY   `place a counselling teacher` approved
               PROVIDED approved
    ELSE PARTY `the employer`
         SHANT `place a counselling teacher` approved
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 6.13.2.1: only candidates with full counselling training and teaching experience are employed"

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `counsellor placement action`
DECIDE `no placement without the senior counsellor's approval` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `place a counselling teacher` approved
          PROVIDED NOT approved
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 6.13.2.2: placement needs the approval of the district's senior counsellor"

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_13__ssec_6_13_2/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_13__ssec_6_13_2/p2 The section's sources (אסמכתא): a list of the circulars it rests on.

§§ `6.13.6 גמול יעוץ`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_13__ssec_6_13_6/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_13__ssec_6_13_6/p2
GIVEN `is a counselling teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `counselling reward` `is a counselling teacher` IS
    IF `is a counselling teacher`
    THEN `the counselling reward set by section 1.12`
    ELSE 0

-- Examples. Nothing below is from a payslip.
`a trained counsellor with experience and an MA` MEANS
    `counsellor candidate` WITH
        `has completed university training in counselling` IS TRUE
        `holds an MA`                                      IS TRUE
        `is studying towards an MA`                        IS FALSE
        `has teaching experience`                          IS TRUE

`a trained counsellor who never taught` MEANS
    `counsellor candidate` WITH
        `has completed university training in counselling` IS TRUE
        `holds an MA`                                      IS TRUE
        `is studying towards an MA`                        IS FALSE
        `has teaching experience`                          IS FALSE

#ASSERT `is a preferred candidate` `a trained counsellor with experience and an MA`
#ASSERT NOT `meets the education requirements for a counselling teacher` `a trained counsellor who never taught`

-- Placed with the senior counsellor's approval: the permission is used.
#TRACE `placing a counselling teacher` `a trained counsellor with experience and an MA` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `place a counselling teacher` TRUE AT 1
-- Placed without it: the prohibition is breached.
#TRACE `no placement without the senior counsellor's approval` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `place a counselling teacher` FALSE AT 1
